afting benches, cooking stations, and build a unique modular stronghold. Survival isn\u2019t just about taking on enemies, it\u2019s about mastering your surroundings and making a home base that fits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494520/extras/973e556e864cff98b6423ae106d8c2cf.poster.avif?t=1757506881\" width=620 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494520/extras/973e556e864cff98b6423ae106d8c2cf.webm?t=1757506881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT IN ADRENALINE-FUELED EXPEDITIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into intense multiplayer PvPvE expedition shootouts on other unstable islands to extract the most valuable resources. Risk it all for sought-after loot, testing your might, shooting skills, and strategic route planning to emerge victorious before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494520/extras/2fc6739136d532783b7f56484ae379d9.poster.avif?t=1757506881\" width=620 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494520/extras/2fc6739136d532783b7f56484ae379d9.webm?t=1757506881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THRIVE ACROSS AN EVER-EVOLVING ARCHIPELAGO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a legendary co-op or solo survivalist while hurricanes, fires, and lightning strikes threaten everything. Dense fog shrouds the landscape in an eerie silence. Bravery is a necessity as you continue your adventure and navigate the challenging dynamic environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494520/extras/ef11aed347ee76b85867aafb34487d3d.poster.avif?t=1757506881\" width=620 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494520/extras/ef11aed347ee76b85867aafb34487d3d.webm?t=1757506881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lost Rift uses dedicated, geo-located servers to provide a smooth and consistent experience across PvE and PvPvE.</i></p>","developers":["People Can Fly"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494520/c146ae083e5fc5a34402aff989677a7bcfcd9050/header.jpg?t=1757506881","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"People Can Fly and People Can Fly Logo are registered trademarks of PCF Group S.A. and Lost Rift, Lost Rift Logo are trademarks of PCF Group S.A. All Content, Game Titles, Trademarks, Logos, Brand Names, and Company Names are the property of their respective owners and/or licensors.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257186218,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257186218/movie480.mp4?t=1755716463","max":"http://video.akamai.ste